<title>UK: WASSALL MULLS GENERAL CABLE STAKE SALE.</title>
<headline>WASSALL MULLS GENERAL CABLE STAKE SALE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British diversified industrial group Wassall Plc said on Thursday it was considering selling its remaining 19.5 percent stake in U.S. cable company General Cable Corp.</p>
<p>Wassall said it had filed an S-1 registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission in connection with the potential sale of the stake.  </p>
<p>Wassall floated its General Cable division in the U.S. in May, netting 202 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
